{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d1d6006945d280a770","chatId":"aa633992ed9a42e98ed3425be45d3ba1","sessionId":null,"userId":68942,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1127,"promptTokens":1489,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:25"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008571595801582094,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d1d6006945d280a76f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369745881,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d1d6006945d280a76f","chatId":"aa633992ed9a42e98ed3425be45d3ba1","sessionId":null,"userId":68942,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n沫沫热爱跳舞，将其作为摆脱紧张生活的一种途径。今天，她的客户多次拒绝了她的工作，导致她受到了老板的训斥。到达舞蹈工作室后，她放下包，然后开始尖叫，紧接着开始跳舞。跳完舞后，沫沫闭上眼睛，在镜子前向自己点了点头。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，沫沫最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 释怀\nB) 伤心\nC) 生气\nD) 绝望\nE) 娱乐\nF) 愧疚\n\n## 问题 2\n沫沫为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 起初，她对自己的一天感到沮丧，但是她开始跳舞来减轻压力，并感到轻松释怀\nB) 她被她的老板表扬\nC) 她终于满足了客户的期望\nD) 客户在多次修改后接受了她的工作。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008571595801582094,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d1d6006945d280a770","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369745879,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"db2d99518a6745bb87e7ca2a992cc648"}